# KN-001: Catalyst particle size changes surface-controlled peroxide decomposition
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 MnO2 0.001mol
grind v1 MnO2 500um
add v1 H2O2 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 MnO2 0.001mol
grind v2 MnO2 50um
add v2 H2O2 0.001mol
wait 10s
inspect
